Package: thermalert
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: lm-sensors, gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: temperature monitor for the GNOME system status area
 Thermalert monitors hardware temperature sensors through libsensors. It
 displays a selected or automatically chosen temperature in the system status
 area and provides real-time graphs, configurable thresholds, and desktop
 notifications.
